         text="In the confusion after the Afghans crush the Marathas at Panipat in January, the Jat raja Suraj Mal of Bharatpur takes Agra and its fort. The Jats strip palaces and tombs of their valuables; tradition says the silver doors of the Taj were carried off. They hold the city until 1774.",
